{"id":6183,"date":"2021-02-24T19:31:19","date_gmt":"2021-02-24T16:31:19","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/gruv-apps.com\/?p=6183"},"modified":"2021-02-26T13:31:55","modified_gmt":"2021-02-26T10:31:55","slug":"mm-master-of-mind-3-8-pins","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/en.gruv-apps.com\/mm-master-of-mind-3-8-pins\/","title":{"rendered":"MM &#8212; Master of Mind (3-8 pins)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Remember the classic Master Mind game from the Seventies?<br>It is also called &#171;Bulls and Cows&#187;.<br>You might know this game from your childhood as it is a digital version of the classic Mastermind board game.<br>Now it&#8217;s available for FREE for your phone and tablet.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The goal is to guess the hidden color combinations.<br>Your opponent (the computer \/ phone) creates a combination of up to four colors and hides it at the top of the game board.<br>Your task is to try out different color combinations until you match the hidden code.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>After each try, you get a hint to see how many colors you have correct:<br>-Black key: There is a color that is in the combination and at the right place.<br>-White key: There is a color that is in the combination but not at the right place.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The challenge is to pick the correct color code as quickly as possible \u2014 in other words,<br>to see how fast you can guess the hidden color combination.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Its a very addictive puzzle game.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are 3 categories of difficulty and 6 groups by dimension (3 pins, 4 pins, 5 pins, 6 pins, 7 pins, 8 pins).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Each categorie has 50 &#8212; 1000 levels.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are more then 10000 tasks.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Remember the classic Master Mind game from the Seventies?It is also called &#171;Bulls and Cows&#187;.You might know this game from your childhood as it is a digital version of the classic Mastermind board game.Now it&#8217;s available for FREE for